---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="The Privacy Policy of Usolutions Consulting." lang="en">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-slate-100">Last updated: May 2026</p>
      
      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-h3:text-primary-800 prose-a:text-primary-600">
        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how our firm ("we", "the firm", "Usolutions Consulting") collects, uses, and protects your personal data when you visit and use our website.</p>

        <h3>1. What Data We Collect</h3>
        <p>While using our website, we may collect the following data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> First Name, Last Name, and Email Address that you provide when filling out the contact form.</li>
          <li><strong>Anonymous Usage Statistics:</strong> Browsing data via web analytics tools (e.g., time spent, pages visited, device/browser type), which cannot identify you personally.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2. Purpose of Processing</h3>
        <p>Your data is collected exclusively for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your requests or inquiries via the contact form.</li>
          <li>To optimize the user experience of our website and evaluate the effectiveness of our content through statistical analysis.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3. Legal Basis for Processing</h3>
        <p>The processing of personal data is based on:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your consent, when submitting the contact form.</li>
          <li>Our legitimate interest, for analyzing and improving the website through anonymous analytics.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4. Data Retention Period</h3>
        <p>Your personal data is retained only for as long as necessary to fulfill the above purposes and is then securely deleted.</p>

        <h3>5. Data Transfer</h3>
        <p>We do not transfer or share your personal data with third parties unless required by law.</p>

        <h3>6. Your Rights</h3>
        <p>Under the GDPR, you have the following rights:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access to your personal data</li>
          <li>Correction or deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Restriction or objection to processing</li>
          <li>Data portability</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can exercise your rights by contacting us at <a href="mailto:info@usolutions.gr">info@usolutions.gr</a>.</p>

        <h3>7. Cookies and Tracking</h3>
        <p>Our website uses cookies solely to collect anonymous statistical data. We do not use cookies for commercial or advertising purposes.</p>

        <h3>8. Contact</h3>
        <p>For any questions regarding the Privacy Policy or to exercise your rights, you can contact us via email or the contact form.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
